    <p>
        Swap seats with a partner and run a silent playtest — the <a href="2.4.html">2.4</a>
        rules: you watch, they play, nobody speaks. Watch for:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Did they notice the turret before it fired, or was the first hit a surprise?</li>
        <li>Did they try to dodge the bullets, or just sprint through the damage?</li>
        <li>Which of your turret personalities was most satisfying to evade — and which one made them stop trying?</li>
        <li>Did they ever work out what the detection range was, or did it feel random to them?</li>
    </ul>


